  "difficulty_level": "H2",
  "difficulty_reason": "H2 is attached to the full general scalar-factor construction, not189-215 transport alone and not221-233 mulLeft substitution. AddEquiv317-362 explicitly restricts the coordinate automorphisms to compact C_i on a cofinite J, constructs inverse restrictions and the conjugating product equivalence, and proves that Haar factors have finite exceptional support;368-386 constructs the open principal-filter inclusion into the cofinite restricted product. FiniteDimensional89-122 proves transvection measure preservation using rectangles, product Haar and one-coordinate marginal translation;125-174 then builds the determinant formula by diagonal/transvection/product induction, and204-225 transports it through a finite basis. AdeleRing70-85,160-185 and189-215 apply these constructed formulas, determinant base change and the given arithmetic product formula to the actual general finite-dimensional linear automorphism. Source types/regularity hypotheses remain authoritative. Global units221-233 are an uncounted consequence.",
